---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const updated = new Date().toISOString().slice(0, 10);
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="How Citizenship Hub, a project by Built Brilliant, collects, uses, and protects your information."
>
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-12 sm:px-6">
    <nav class="mb-4 text-sm text-slate-500" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
      <a href="/" class="transition hover:text-slate-900">Home</a>
      <span aria-hidden="true" class="mx-1.5 text-slate-300">·</span>
      <span class="text-slate-700">Privacy Policy</span>
    </nav>

    <h1 class="font-display text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-slate-900 sm:text-4xl">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-500">Last updated: {updated}</p>

    <div class="mt-8 space-y-10 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600">
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-slate-900">1. Who we are</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          Citizenship Hub ("the Site") is owned and operated by{' '}
          <a
            href="https://builtbrilliant.com"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener"
            class="font-medium text-brand-700 underline-offset-2 hover:underline"
          >
            Built Brilliant
          </a>
          , which acts as the data controller for any personal information collected through the Site.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-slate-900">2. Information we collect</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">We keep data collection minimal and do not sell personal information. We may collect:</p>
        <ul class="mt-2 list-disc space-y-1 pl-5">
          <li>
            <strong class="font-medium text-slate-900">Contact details</strong> you submit through the lead form (for
            example, your name and email address).
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong class="font-medium text-slate-900">Anonymous usage data</strong>, such as the pages you visit,
            on-site searches, and how far you scroll, used to understand how the Site is used.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong class="font-medium text-slate-900">Technical data</strong>, such as browser type, device type,
            approximate location, and referring site, collected via analytics.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-slate-900">3. Cookies</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          The Site uses an anonymous session cookie for attribution and analytics purposes. An additional cookie is used
          only for the authenticated administration console and is not set for ordinary visitors. You can control or
          delete cookies through your browser settings.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-slate-900">4. Third-party services</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          We use Cloudflare Web Analytics to measure aggregated, privacy-respecting traffic and performance data.
          Cloudflare may process this data in accordance with its own privacy policy.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-slate-900">5. How we use information</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">We use the information we collect to:</p>
        <ul class="mt-2 list-disc space-y-1 pl-5">
          <li>respond to enquiries and provide the services you request;</li>
          <li>improve the Site and understand how visitors use it; and</li>
          <li>maintain the security and performance of the Site.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-slate-900">6. Data retention</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          We retain personal information only for as long as necessary to fulfil the purposes described above or as
          required by law. Anonymous analytics data is retained in aggregate form.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-slate-900">7. Your rights</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          Depending on your jurisdiction, you may have the right to access, correct, or delete your personal
          information, or to object to or restrict its processing. To exercise these rights, please contact us.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-slate-900">8. Contact</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          Privacy questions can be directed to{' '}
          <a
            href="https://builtbrilliant.com"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener"
            class="font-medium text-brand-700 underline-offset-2 hover:underline"
          >
            Built Brilliant
          </a>
          .
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
